{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23131","headline":"春忆二林寺旧游因寄朗满晦三上人 · 白居易","name":"春忆二林寺旧游因寄朗满晦三上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一别东林三度春，每春常似忆情亲。\n头陀会里爲逋客，供俸班中作老臣。\n清净久辞香火伴，尘劳难索幻泡身。\n最惭僧社题桥处，十八人名空一人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23131.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23131","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}